{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "ef75bc66-0add-8e4f-82a9-5c3bc08cd0b6",
  "created_at": "2026-01-30T15:09:50-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Sarah Rahman",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tony Ferreira",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T15:07:35-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Tony. Good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T15:07:38-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, hello, pardon me. Is this the water and sewer billing? I always thought this office was on the other side of town."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T15:07:46-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is, yeah. Water and sewer billing. And a lot of folks say that, we've got a couple of offices. What can I help you with?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T15:07:55-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, my water bill came and it's much higher than usual. I think the meter reading is wrong. Pardon me, can you hear me all right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T15:08:04-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you fine. Can I get your name and the name on the account?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T15:08:10-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sarah Rahman. But the account is still in my husband's name. He passed, and I never got it changed over. It's under Rahman, Imran."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T15:08:18-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I've got it. I'm sorry for your loss. So I'm seeing this quarter's usage is way above the last few. Is that what's bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T15:08:27-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It's almost double. I live alone. I'm not running a laundromat. I'd like the read checked again, please. Somebody should look at that meter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T15:08:36-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can put in a request to have the meter re-read. They'll also check for a stuck register. Might be a leak on your side too, so keep an eye on the toilets."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T15:08:48-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I did check those. Nothing running. Pardon me, one more thing. Is there any discount for people on a low income, or elderly? I'm on a fixed income now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T15:08:58-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There's a senior and low-income assistance form. I can mail you one, or you can pick it up at the counter. Want me to send it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T15:09:07-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please, mail it. And also, I paid the last bill by card, and I'm not sure it went through on the right one. It's the card ending in four four one eight."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T15:09:18-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me look. Yep, the December payment shows on a card ending in four four one eight. So that one went through fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T15:09:26-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh good, that's the one. Thank you. I just wanted to be sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T15:09:31-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Is the best number for the meter crew the one you're calling from?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T15:09:37-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0171. Pardon me, did you get all that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T15:09:41-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0171. Meter re-read is in, and the form goes out in the mail. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T15:09:47-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's all. Thank you, Tony. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
